Reduced False Positives, Increased Accuracy 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌


Hi! 

Maddie from Originality.AI here...

We have huge news! We are thrilled to announce the highly-anticipated
launch of our newest

**AI Detection Model 2.0!**

This model represents a significant milestone in our journey towards
providing the most accurate and reliable AI content detection solution
in the world.

We have made a **MASSIVE update to our accuracy study**
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdGlvbi1hY2N1cmFjeQ==&sig=Ez9rVXFdSb7AorKvenPYMQNmmZUPCAocKLvhVKe97B6Z&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29687> to accompany
this release, along with open sourcing both our Benchmark Dataset, and a
Tool that will make it easy to test the efficacy of any AI Content
Detection tools with your OWN dataset. 

We took this approach because we believe: 

* In transparent and accountable development and use of AI. 

* AI detectors have a role to play in mitigating some of the potential
negative societal impacts of generative AI.

* AI detection tools "accuracy" should be communicated with the same


**transparency** and 

**accountability** that we want to see in AI's 

**development** and 

**use**. 

Our Case Study
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdGlvbi1hY2N1cmFjeQ==&sig=Ez9rVXFdSb7AorKvenPYMQNmmZUPCAocKLvhVKe97B6Z&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29687> also shows
very clearly that Originality.AI <https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZPcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5BSQ==&sig=BS8qGQXiCcrNNMzepFteygRc6NaK4BtgsGAD9aQ7eBBt&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29688>dominates the
AI Detection industry with our performance across all available
datasets. 

It's very hard to argue with data science. 

****Below is a Brief Synopsis Model 2.0 Changes: ****

**1. Reduced False Positives:**

Our #1 priority was to reduce the instances of false positives and with
this release, our team has successfully achieved this. 

While we have always emphasized that AI detection will NEVER be 100%
perfect, this major improvement ensures that model 2.0 delivers more
precise results showing a 

**14.1% Reduction in False Positives! **

**2. Improved Accuracy on the Hardest to Detect AI Content: **

2.0 shows an improvement in detecting the most challenging LLM models (
GPT4 ChatGPT, Paraphrase content). We have bolstered the accuracy and
have improved our accuracy by 

**4.3%**! 

**3. Open Source Initiatives:**

**Release of Open Source Benchmark Dataset:**

In the spirit of openness and progress, we are excited to share our
benchmark dataset with the AI community. This dataset serves as a
valuable resource for training and evaluating AI detection models,
fostering collaboration and innovation in our industry. 

Download the dataset 

**here** <https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZnaXRodWIuY29tJTJGT3JpZ2luYWxpdHlBSSUyRkFJLWRldGVjdG9yLXJlc2VhcmNoLXRvb2w=&sig=DVrGCDxonW8MJuBix9EZahqfG5joofvnbGSkywqPtKef&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29689>

**Release of Open Source AI Detection Efficacy Testing Tool:**

To promote transparency and a standardized evaluation of AI detection
tools, we are releasing a FREE Open-Source AI detection efficacy testing
tool. 

This tool will equip researchers and developers with the means to easily
assess the performance of all available AI detection tools with their
own datasets to eliminate any biases. 

Check out Our New Free Tool
here: **https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZnaXRodWIuY29tJTJGT3JpZ2luYWxpdHlBSSUyRkFJLWRldGVjdG9yLXJlc2VhcmNoLXRvb2wlMkElMkE=&sig=7L4uN5panww3bg9sMmW2rid6rryFEC6zjjomm4DPUzs8&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29692
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZnaXRodWIuY29tJTJGT3JpZ2luYWxpdHlBSSUyRkFJLWRldGVjdG9yLXJlc2VhcmNoLXRvb2wlMkZ0cmVlJTJGbWFpbg==&sig=9tq8ghvrVm4DzyTvuyP6t45sQerB77Rc2867ZN1phRkd&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29690>

******See how the Tool works Below: ******

  

https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZ5b3V0dS5iZSUyRlVmdkNOVTdBVTVB&sig=3jXBH2JP3xCK1L2eVSdGRbAG4dHPmkQmE3yVfKr4taHV&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29691 

****Some Other Newsworthy Notes: ****
As some of you might have heard, OpenAI discontinued their text
classifier due to its " poor rate of  accuracy". 

There have been a lot of questions around this. If OpenAI can't detect
its OWN content, then how can anyone else? What does this mean for AI
detection? 

We believe that with OpenAI being at the forefront of AI technology and
essentially viewed as the creators of AI generated content, meant that
their approach to AI detection likely had to be more conservative and
cautious. 

Developing an AI detection tool is not an easy task! It requires working
through complex challenges as well as acknowledging that there is never
going to be a 100% perfectly accurate solution, no matter what! 

Balancing the need for accuracy while avoiding the backlash of false
positives is a delicate tightrope to walk, even more so for OpenAI than
anyone else. 

**Last bit and then I'll shutup...**

The need for continued transparency and accountability in this industry
is crucial, which is why our 2.0 release is being accompanied by Open
Source initiatives. We believe that anyone should be able to test the
data for themselves to easily assess the efficacy of any tool while
deciding which one they will use for their QA. 

Our commitment to continuous improvement and openness remains at the
forefront of what we do, and we sincerely thank you for being a part of
our community! 

As always, constructive feedback is welcome! 

See Updated Accuracy Study
<https://jonhaver.lt.acemlnb.com/Prod/link-tracker?redirectUrl=aHR0cHMlM0ElMkYlMkZvcmlnaW5hbGl0eS5haSUyRmJsb2clMkZhaS1jb250ZW50LWRldGVjdGlvbi1hY2N1cmFjeQ==&sig=Ez9rVXFdSb7AorKvenPYMQNmmZUPCAocKLvhVKe97B6Z&iat=1690900786&a=%7C%7C798597961%7C%7C&account=jonhaver%2Eactivehosted%2Ecom&email=%2FBaKMgUe6nIp8mPQIG2MuAR3pDcR3Uz4QW9Pqg%2FUD7%2ByNWbZcCHyR2OBFoA%3D%3AUu4%2F2DYpVUxJedePVH5bMog3Qv%2B2fi6D&s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1927A2091A61A29687>

Thanks for reading! Have a great day! 

